      "subcategory": "curriculum",
      "field": "indian_religions",
      "value": "Indian religions are practiced or were founded in the Indian subcontinent and are sometimes classified as the dharmic religions, as they all feature dharma, the specific law of reality and duties expected according to the religion.",
